msgid "%s info"
msgstr "%s 信息"

#: views/help.php:10
#, php-format
msgid "%s is a free, open-source and multilingual server-side program that makes it very easy to publish your genealogical data on the internet as a dynamic and searchable family tree website."
msgstr "%s 是一款免费、开源且支持多语言的服务器端程序，可轻松将家谱数据发布到互联网上，创建动态且可搜索的家谱网站。"

#: views/help.php:15
msgid "Icons"
msgstr "图标"

#: views/help.php:19
msgid "This icon is shown to the left of names of persons in lists or reports. When you hover over this icon with your mouse, a pop-up will be displayed. In the pop-up list you will find several icons with names of reports and charts that you can create from this person (the exact number of icons on the list varies according to the presence of ancestors and/or descendants). Following is a list of those icons and their meaning."
msgstr "此图标显示在列表或报告中人物姓名的左侧。将鼠标悬停在图标上时，会弹出一个菜单。菜单中包含多个图标及其对应的报告和图表名称，可用于查看此人物的相关内容（图标数量取决于此人物是否有祖先和/或后代）。以下列出这些图标及其含义。"

#: views/help.php:23
msgid "A pedigree is a genealogical report of a person's ancestors. A pedigree uses a special method of numbering: the base person is number 1, his father number 2 and his mother number 3. The number of a father is ways twice that of his son and the mother is one number higher. Thus, number 40 is the father of number 20 and 41 is the mother of number 20. <br>From amongst the icons in the pop-up menu you can also choose a graphical display of the ancestor report."
msgstr "祖先谱是展示某个人祖先的家谱报告。祖先谱采用特殊的编号方式：基准人物编号为 1，父亲为 2，母亲为 3。父亲的编号始终是其子女编号的两倍，母亲的编号则比父亲大 1。因此，编号 40 是编号 20 人物的父亲，编号 41 是其母亲。<br>您也可以从弹出菜单的图标中选择以图形方式显示祖先报告。"

#: views/help.php:27
msgid "A descendant report is a genealogical report of a patriarchal couple or of one patriarch (generation I) with their children (generation II) and all further descendants, both along male and female lines. <br>From amongst the icons in the pop-up menu you can also choose a graphical display of the descendant report."
msgstr "后代报告展示一对家族始祖或一位始祖（第一代）、其子女（第二代）以及之后所有世代的后代，包括男性和女性后裔。<br>您也可以从弹出菜单的图标中选择以图形方式显示后代报告。"

#: views/help.php:31
msgid "An outline report is a clear summary of all descendants of one person (and his/her partners), where each generation gets its own (ascending) number."
msgstr "后代概要报告清晰列出某个人及其伴侣的所有后代，并为每一代分配递增的编号。"

#: views/help.php:35
msgid "An ancestor sheet lists 5 generations in table layout, with the base person at the bottom and the ancestors above him/her in increasingly smaller boxes."
msgstr "祖先表以表格形式列出 5 代人物，基准人物位于底部，其祖先显示在上方逐渐缩小的方框中。"

#: views/help.php:39
msgid "A fanchart is a circular chart that shows the ancestors in circles around the base person. This allows for a very clear view of the ancestry of any specific person. The box for each person on the chart is clickable to enable fast access to that person's family sheet. <br> The size of the fanchart and some other settings may be adjusted from the menu to the left of the chart."
msgstr "扇形图以环绕基准人物的圆形图表展示其祖先，使某个人的祖先关系一目了然。图表中每个人物的方框均可点击，以快速打开其家庭页面。<br>您可以通过图表左侧的菜单调整扇形图大小及其他设置。"

#: views/help.php:43
msgid "The timeline chart displays historic events alongside a person's life events to give a context of the time in which the person lived.<br>This chart has its own dedicated help which you can view by hovering the cursor over the word \"Help\" to the left of screen."
msgstr "时间轴图表将历史事件与人物生平事件并列显示，以呈现人物所处时代的背景。<br>此图表有专门的帮助说明，将鼠标悬停在屏幕左侧的“帮助”字样上即可查看。"

#: views/help.php:48
msgid "Top Ribbon"
msgstr "顶部栏"

#: views/help.php:50
msgid "“Search” field and button"
msgstr "“搜索”输入框和按钮"

#: views/help.php:52
#, php-format
msgid "This box appears on all pages of %s and allows you the convenience to search for any persons from the database from any page. Typing in a name and clicking search will display a list of people from the database bearing a name matching the search term."
msgstr "此输入框显示在 %s 的所有页面上，方便您随时搜索数据库中的人物。输入姓名并点击“搜索”，即可查看姓名与搜索词匹配的人物列表。"

#: views/help.php:55
msgid "The orange RSS-icon"
msgstr "橙色 RSS 图标"

#: views/help.php:55
msgid "(only displayed if activated by the site owner and enabled in webbrowser)"
msgstr "（仅在网站所有者启用此功能且浏览器支持时显示）"

#: views/help.php:56
msgid "If you add this feed (as it's called) to your RSS-reader, you will be able to see at one glance who has a birthday!<br>(In the \"Tools\" pull-down menu you may see an \"Anniversary List\" option. That option will display a list of birthdays in the present month)."
msgstr "将此订阅源添加到 RSS 阅读器后，您即可一目了然地查看谁过生日！<br>（“工具”下拉菜单中可能有“纪念日列表”选项，可显示本月生日列表。）"

#: views/help.php:62
msgid "Menu items"
msgstr "菜单项"

#: views/help.php:64 views/help.php:146 views/layout.php:574
msgid "Family tree index"
msgstr "族谱索引"

#: views/help.php:65
msgid "This takes you to the main Persons Index. The \"Home\" page can be replaced by a custom page made by the website owner."
msgstr "此按钮将带您前往人物主索引。“主页”可以替换为网站所有者创建的自定义页面。"

#: views/help.php:69
msgid "Takes you to the main persons index. Same as the \"Home\" button. The list shows all persons in the family tree, sorted alphabetically. A maximum number of 150 persons is displayed. You can press the page numbers to see more. You can chose between \"Concise view\" or \"Expanded view\". In the expanded view (ex)partners are also displayed, that are not shown in concise view."
msgstr "前往人物主索引，与“主页”按钮相同。列表按字母顺序显示家谱中的所有人物，每页最多显示 150 人。点击页码可查看更多人物。您可以选择“简洁视图”或“扩展视图”；扩展视图还会显示简洁视图中不显示的前任伴侣。"

#: views/help.php:73
msgid "Here you will find a list of all family names, followed by the number of persons who carry that name."
msgstr "此处列出所有姓氏及使用该姓氏的人物数量。"

#: views/help.php:76 views/help.php:81 views/help.php:86
msgid "(only displayed if activated by the site owner)"
msgstr "（仅在网站所有者启用后显示）"

#: views/help.php:77
msgid "Here you can search by place of birth, baptism, by address, place of death or burial. You can search with the options: \"contains\", \"equals\" and \"starts with\". Here too, you can choose between expanded or concise view. The results will be sorted alphabetically by place name."
msgstr "您可以按出生地、洗礼地、地址、死亡地或安葬地搜索。可选择“包含”“等于”或“开头为”等搜索条件。此处也可以选择扩展视图或简洁视图。结果将按地点名称的字母顺序排列。"

#: views/help.php:81 views/layout.php:593
msgid "Photobook"
msgstr "相册"

#: views/help.php:82
msgid "Here you will see a display of all photos in the database.<br>Click on a photo for an enlarged version or click on the name to move to the family page of that person."
msgstr "此处显示数据库中的所有照片。<br>点击照片可查看大图，点击姓名可前往该人物的家庭页面。"

#: views/help.php:86 views/help.php:90 views/help.php:95 views/help.php:100 views/help.php:105 views/help.php:109 views/help.php:114 views/layout.php:637
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

#: views/help.php:87
msgid "Here you will find a list of all sources used in the genealogical research."
msgstr "此处列出家谱研究中使用的所有来源。"

#: views/help.php:90 views/layout.php:641
msgid "Anniversary list"
msgstr "本月生日"

#: views/help.php:91
msgid "This opens a list with all persons in the selected tree who have a birthday in the current month. You can also choose a different month than the current one."
msgstr "此处显示所选家谱中本月过生日的所有人物。您也可以选择其他月份。"

#: views/help.php:96
msgid "The information given in the statistics table doesnt warrant further explanation."
msgstr "统计表中的信息无需进一步说明。"

#: views/help.php:101
msgid ""
"With the relationship calculator you can establish blood and/or marital relations between two people. In the search field \"Name\" you can enter a name. For example first name, last name, call name, part of name or leave a field empty. Then you can click \"search\" and consequently pick a name from the result list. Once two names have been selected, you can click \"Calculate relationship\" and if a relationship is found it will be listed together with a graphical representation. You can press the change symbol to switch between the "
"persons."
msgstr "使用亲属关系计算器，您可以查找两个人之间的血缘关系和/或姻亲关系。在“姓名”搜索框中，您可以输入名字、姓氏、常用名、部分姓名，也可以留空。然后点击“搜索”，并从结果列表中选择姓名。选定两个人物后，点击“计算亲属关系”；如果找到关系，系统会列出结果并提供图形表示。点击切换图标可交换两个人物。"

#: views/help.php:106
msgid "This will display a world map relating to the people present in the database, with ability to map by births or deaths."
msgstr "此处显示数据库中人物相关的世界地图，并可按出生地或死亡地绘制地点。"

#: views/help.php:109 views/layout.php:661
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "联系"

#: views/help.php:110
msgid "This will open an email form, similar to the one explained above (see “owner family tree”)."
msgstr "此处将打开电子邮件表单，类似于上文所述的表单（参见“家谱所有者”）。"

#: views/help.php:115
msgid "This will display a list of new and recently changed people in the database. A fully scrollable list is displayed in reverse chronological date order, with the most recent items displayed first. There is a search field that allows you to narrow the list of results down. It accepts partial names, e.g. searching for “Sa” will return all people with SA in their name, such as Sam, Sarah, Susanne, or even people with the surname Samson for example."
msgstr "此处将显示数据库中新建和最近修改的人物列表。列表可完整滚动，并按日期倒序排列，最新项目显示在最前面。您可以使用搜索框缩小结果范围，也可以输入部分姓名。例如搜索“Sa”会返回姓名中包含 SA 的人物，如 Sam、Sarah、Susanne，甚至姓 Samson 的人物。"

#: views/help.php:120
msgid "If the site owner gave you a username and password, you can log in here to see data that is not shown to the general public (such as details of living people or \"hidden\" family trees)"
msgstr "如果网站所有者为您提供了用户名和密码，您可以在此登录，查看不向公众显示的数据（例如在世人物的详细信息或“隐藏”的家谱）。"

#: views/help.php:124
msgid "Language Flags"
msgstr "语言旗帜"

#: views/help.php:125
msgid "On the menu bar, to the right of the menu buttons, you will notice several national flags, that allow you to change the display language."
msgstr "菜单栏的菜单按钮右侧有多个国家旗帜，点击即可切换显示语言。"

#: views/help.php:129 views/help.php:136 views/layout.php:693 views/user_settings.php:15
msgid "User settings"
msgstr "用户设置"

#: views/help.php:130
msgid "This page contains several user settings: selecting a theme and changing password (if allowed)."
msgstr "此页面包含多项用户设置：选择主题以及更改密码（如果允许）。"

#: views/help.php:138
msgid "”Select a theme” dropdown"
msgstr "“选择主题”下拉菜单"

#: views/help.php:140
#, php-format
msgid "By default, %s is provided with several color schemes, and so long as the site administrator has not disabled them, they will appear in this dropdown list. You can select a theme to your preference, that will change elements such as page color, background images, etc. These themes will only affect your experience on %s and will make no changes to your internet browser or computer."
msgstr "默认情况下，%s 提供多种配色方案；只要网站管理员未禁用，这些方案就会显示在下拉列表中。您可以选择喜欢的主题，以更改页面颜色、背景图片等。主题只影响您浏览 %s 网站时的显示效果，不会更改您的浏览器或电脑设置。"

#: views/help.php:148
msgid "Owner family tree"
msgstr "家谱所有者"

#: views/help.php:149
msgid "Clicking the name of the site owner will open an email form that allows you to send the site owner a short notice. Please enter your name and email address, so you can be answered. If you wish to send the site owner an attachment (such as a photo or a document) you can use this form to ask the site owner for his email. Then you can use any regular email program to send those attachments. (The email address of the site owner is not published on the site to prevent spamming)."
msgstr "点击网站所有者的姓名会打开电子邮件表单，您可以通过该表单向网站所有者发送简短消息。请填写姓名和电子邮件地址，以便对方回复。如果您要发送附件（例如照片或文档），可以通过此表单向网站所有者索取电子邮件地址，然后使用常规邮件程序发送附件。（为防止垃圾邮件，网站不会公开所有者的电子邮件地址。）"

#: views/help.php:152
